OL,3,AFaisal Islam: What's in the Brexit
OL,4,Areset food deal and are there
OL,5,Atrade-offs?
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Boston, Lincolnshire, a supplier of
OL,8,Fready meals to Marks & Spencer (M&S)
OL,9,Fmanufactures thousands of portions of
OL,10,Fspaghetti bolognese to be sent to the
OL,11,Fretailer's shops in the Republic of
OL,12,FIreland.
OL,14,FEvery plastic pallet is meticulously
OL,15,Findividually tagged with a green-grey
OL,16,Flabel "Eire".
OL,18,FIt has been this way since Brexit.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
